   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **ESP to Paul Hoffman**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Doin Things Right**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Peggy O**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **US Blues**: back after 202 archived shows (1225 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Tennessee [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-02-06.FLAC** (recommended): audience recording; 19 songs; 135 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener says the recording sounds good [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recording was made with permission from the band, the sound crew and the Capitol Theatre staff [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-02-06.FLAC**: taped by Capt. Greg; transferred by Capt. Greg; source: AUD [1]. Also: Audience recording taped by Captain Greg at 24/48K, with the microphones about seven feet up (R.O.B.) [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Worthpoint: [Billy Strings Poster Deja Tu Owl Capitol Theatre NY 2/6/2022 Show LE300 Signed | #4719846998](https://www.worthpoint.com/worthopedia/billy-strings-poster-deja-tu-owl-4719846998) [4]\n- Poster by Brandon Wenerd: [Listen: Billy Strings 'Deja Tu' Capitol Theatre Shows Are Now On nugs.net](https://brobible.com/culture/article/billy-strings-capitol-theatre-shows/) [5]",
